<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114453" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χοροίτῠπ-ος</span></b>  (parox.), <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χορο-τύπος,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>beating the ground in the
				choral dance,</i> generally, <i>dancing,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				156
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				3.250
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				9.202
			</span></i>, al.; cj. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειροκτύπῳ</span>
			in <i><span class="en">
				Telest.
				1.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> proparox.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χοροίτυπος, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,</span>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>played for</i> or <i>to the choral dance,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χέλυς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Merc.</u>
					31
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>danced over,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλσος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					13.95
				</span></i>
			.</div>
